WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.640
SUPERCELL

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:05.160
They were inseparable,
like a boy and his dog.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.840
And every year
they looked forward to Hammer Jam.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.160
Until one fateful day.

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:13.880
HAMMER JAM

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.120
Just days until Hammer Jam,

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:20.040
villagers are reckoning
with a devastating blow.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:22.880
The Builder's beloved hammer
has disappeared.

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:26.160
Will Hammer Jam be cancelled
for the first time ever?

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:30.440
It had to be a goblin.
I mean, stealing is what they do, right?

00:00:31.360 --> 00:00:33.880
All I'm saying is the witch looks guilty.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:36.040
Whee, my voice sounds so deep!

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:38.200
A stolen hammer.

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:40.080
Shattered tradition. 

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:42.640
A village full of suspects.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:46.040
Hammerless: a true crime
in a fantasy world.

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:49.520
Listen to our true crime podcast
and share your theories

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:51.520
to find the hammer and save Hammer Jam.

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:54.360
HAMMERLESS:
A TRUE CRIME PODCAST IN A FANTASY WORLD

00:00:54.440 --> 00:00:57.600
CLASH OF CLANS

